  "selected_alignment_score_max": 0.667867,
  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Lying in bed would be an altogether perfect and supreme experience if only one had a coloured pencil long enough to draw on the ceiling.",
      "output_sha256": "3a63b324f4a274187c62652b5fb6b49d4849cdd77dd46c963420efdc7a016e3c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "3a63b324f4a274187c62652b5fb6b49d4849cdd77dd46c963420efdc7a016e3c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "This, however, is not generally a part of the domestic apparatus on the premises.",
      "output_sha256": "67ff835c32693f957ac85863792dc6f4bd9dab7ebdb201fadb5cc969d8fb8be8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "67ff835c32693f957ac85863792dc6f4bd9dab7ebdb201fadb5cc969d8fb8be8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I think it might be possible to achieve this effect with a few buckets of paint and a broom.",
      "output_sha256": "ae76cfd8ad606cc0ea933bca73d687c9e2175f14db11fbe5a87e9c5761ee534d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.463947,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5a7f51e952b8c0ef024e33c365bca2be5378b66675fcc3beeb528310fd3f2943"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ae76cfd8ad606cc0ea933bca73d687c9e2175f14db11fbe5a87e9c5761ee534d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Only if one worked in a really sweeping and masterly way, and laid on the colour in great washes, it might drip down again on one’s face in floods of rich and mingled colour like some strange fairy rain; and that would have its disadvantages.",
      "output_sha256": "2383ca37eaad4ab42391dce34c42d2ab36e306153f1eee99b8f9a129d07edc74",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "2383ca37eaad4ab42391dce34c42d2ab36e306153f1eee99b8f9a129d07edc74",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I am afraid it would be necessary to stick to black and white in this form of artistic composition.",
      "output_sha256": "dae2dfc879ee7c89ff9a5755cbf1ba967886855c3b591f8211b4a8d1972203fa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "dae2dfc879ee7c89ff9a5755cbf1ba967886855c3b591f8211b4a8d1972203fa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "To that purpose, indeed, the white ceiling would be of the greatest possible use; in fact, it is the only use I think of a white ceiling being put to.",
      "output_sha256": "54f60d8b29818fe9960f31ebcee7e4a78d0aff6de0024f85a3838ee536f0250c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "54f60d8b29818fe9960f31ebcee7e4a78d0aff6de0024f85a3838ee536f0250c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Had it not been for the enlightening experience of lying in bed for an extended period, I might never have stumbled upon this realization.",
      "output_sha256": "9f14cfebde06331c1c264174a74d0be3c3827777b43781635a95fe2bdfbc053b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.441484,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "975990a6e816ab7459cccb9edccbeeadc96761c73a8c4a8bfe9d095ebbd62dca"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9f14cfebde06331c1c264174a74d0be3c3827777b43781635a95fe2bdfbc053b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "For years, I sought out unblemished surfaces in contemporary homes to sketch upon.",
      "output_sha256": "07e1f0d29007c40d9e7afdba552b6df1073454211ceb1f1fe2b4e34192702348",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.371691,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "aa61255098dad03b2980bfff58c7630d12913a9d5cae7e7dca248f69bbf5c0e4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "07e1f0d29007c40d9e7afdba552b6df1073454211ceb1f1fe2b4e34192702348",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Unfortunately, standard paper felt far too small for any grand allegorical work; as Cyrano de Bergerac aptly states, “Il me faut des géants.”",
      "output_sha256": "dcafabece382a086aa5b45ed971c1ed5814c82b3f38762b6ead3ddc66549d52f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.667867,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6904c69dc7185620027173c55688efd0910ad814da6d67f3ac764af3584cffbf"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "dcafabece382a086aa5b45ed971c1ed5814c82b3f38762b6ead3ddc66549d52f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But when I tried to find these fine clear spaces in the modern rooms such as we all live in I was continually disappointed.",
      "output_sha256": "aa938d53d2d2de7b8b846e08972c79fe45b26bece292eccb09f5ffdf07da071b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "aa938d53d2d2de7b8b846e08972c79fe45b26bece292eccb09f5ffdf07da071b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I encountered a relentless array of intricate patterns and small objects that seemed to weave a dense curtain between me and my creative aspirations.",
      "output_sha256": "cc3a82944ce4718887bc098e2e637d17c71d96965058db9be8c88189264e4c41",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.456159,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7358c451ba6801bcb599a031e988a32caa9f0de82d72234c4740cff2e8c59387"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cc3a82944ce4718887bc098e2e637d17c71d96965058db9be8c88189264e4c41",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I examined the walls; I found them to my surprise to be already covered with wallpaper, and I found the wallpaper to be already covered with uninteresting images, all bearing a ridiculous resemblance to each other.",
      "output_sha256": "b1f8c3ee9fa4f313dfd0d976121d31aeb201160188cf9ddac951f0cf1cc7a72d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "b1f8c3ee9fa4f313dfd0d976121d31aeb201160188cf9ddac951f0cf1cc7a72d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I could not understand why one arbitrary symbol (a symbol apparently entirely devoid of any religious or philosophical significance) should thus be sprinkled all over my nice walls like a sort of small-pox.",
      "output_sha256": "5f3e5ba9accd040f58435d3a60cd16793811076471aa733366ebf7ec8b01e5a6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "5f3e5ba9accd040f58435d3a60cd16793811076471aa733366ebf7ec8b01e5a6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The Bible must be referring to wallpapers, I think, when it says, “Use not vain repetitions, as the Gentiles do.”",
      "output_sha256": "899b9279206f63145f2337fcde46c5e8e581d742a97c887a87984dc6c11e179d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "899b9279206f63145f2337fcde46c5e8e581d742a97c887a87984dc6c11e179d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The Turkey carpet, too, was a chaotic blend of colors, reminiscent of the Turkish Empire or perhaps the confection known as Turkish Delight.",
      "output_sha256": "b4af8893ffe0b484cfd728ace0b7a9f36f072d35c5ce8b04f571c9b90187ef58",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.542733,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f2608a15894bc23f0655ea98fc16a704b753c083af1eb981a7eedace98f3b126"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b4af8893ffe0b484cfd728ace0b7a9f36f072d35c5ce8b04f571c9b90187ef58",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I do not exactly know what Turkish Delight really is; but I suppose it is Macedonian Massacres.",
      "output_sha256": "dd1885d14dfdd02238c6fdb81ef4942dd5943a677dbb03357a3ffd52bdd357fe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "dd1885d14dfdd02238c6fdb81ef4942dd5943a677dbb03357a3ffd52bdd357fe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Everywhere that I went forlornly, with my pencil or my paint brush, I found that others had unaccountably been before me, spoiling the walls, the curtains, and the furniture with their childish and barbaric designs.",
      "output_sha256": "94af9966ed7f784d405ee00c87a2731457b4af403a3b7c3a968927c9395119ac",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "94af9966ed7f784d405ee00c87a2731457b4af403a3b7c3a968927c9395119ac",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": ".....",
      "output_sha256": "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Nowhere did I find a really clear space for sketching until this occasion when I prolonged beyond the proper limit the process of lying on my back in bed.",
      "output_sha256": "8cefc774388a48f430c86696a679b1aab8f398dc102ccdb4c26458fe63043a50",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "8cefc774388a48f430c86696a679b1aab8f398dc102ccdb4c26458fe63043a50",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "At that moment, the expanse of white emerged, a celestial ceiling that could symbolize purity and freedom, perhaps even the very definition of Paradise itself.",
      "output_sha256": "9deb017acbdfe5968c8ec2d31f175b60c28086115361176068ad75cfed9dbdad",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.335167,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1618c4e8ef1240fda50309344f5a025e50458c15af6fe3c1ee5a441850d90ddb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9deb017acbdfe5968c8ec2d31f175b60c28086115361176068ad75cfed9dbdad",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But alas! like all heavens, now that it is seen it is found to be unattainable; it looks more austere and more distant than the blue sky outside the window.",
      "output_sha256": "039298ce833f9840b26973ead9c47caa22fa8531e6cf3a2afea08033e47f1e05",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "039298ce833f9840b26973ead9c47caa22fa8531e6cf3a2afea08033e47f1e05",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "For my proposal to paint on it with the bristly end of a broom has been discouraged—never mind by whom; by a person debarred from all political rights—and even my minor proposal to put the other end of the broom into the kitchen fire and turn it to charcoal has not been conceded.",
      "output_sha256": "648533a0f92d5c648d0a11ee7f0de07b0ac4501f3620482902871e3e60761b55",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "648533a0f92d5c648d0a11ee7f0de07b0ac4501f3620482902871e3e60761b55",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Yet I am certain that it was from persons in my position that all the original inspiration came for covering the ceilings of palaces and cathedrals with a riot of fallen angels or victorious gods.",
      "output_sha256": "6d726f3c767e52ce9b5190bc97a2f9be0585553e91eab27f6e01ccf74a0fa22c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "6d726f3c767e52ce9b5190bc97a2f9be0585553e91eab27f6e01ccf74a0fa22c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Surely, it was through the ancient and noble act of lying in bed that Michelangelo envisioned transforming the Sistine Chapel’s ceiling into a grand portrayal of celestial drama, worthy of divine interpretation.",
      "output_sha256": "40a360a4dc65a37e67aa6febe6b4ce5e557005c18689ff0730cfb9a25b4fd96f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.350458,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "af49616de7973387db527a48509937b39c327174059fbe2a1d1970d3096a495b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "40a360a4dc65a37e67aa6febe6b4ce5e557005c18689ff0730cfb9a25b4fd96f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The tone now commonly taken toward the practice of lying in bed is hypocritical and unhealthy.",
      "output_sha256": "ac6313291ca442a7a4b77e2fe01a536105812be675202c3217c2f25d9ed74bb8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "ac6313291ca442a7a4b77e2fe01a536105812be675202c3217c2f25d9ed74bb8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Of all the marks of modernity that seem to mean a kind of decadence, there is none more menacing and dangerous than the exultation of very small and secondary matters of conduct at the expense of very great and primary ones, at the expense of eternal ties and tragic human morality.",
      "output_sha256": "828b3849dcd67e568eedbb1ce4a60f64ce4d32530e0376106ea157da844dea91",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "828b3849dcd67e568eedbb1ce4a60f64ce4d32530e0376106ea157da844dea91",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If there is one thing worse than the modern weakening of major morals, it is the modern strengthening of minor morals.",
      "output_sha256": "2aec7ca73f66fbd8edd82de70ac643f9ed8f90252792ee8bb81aebfd9bb59370",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "2aec7ca73f66fbd8edd82de70ac643f9ed8f90252792ee8bb81aebfd9bb59370",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It seems that in our current climate, it is deemed more damaging to accuse someone of poor taste than to call into question their ethical integrity.",
      "output_sha256": "fa7e0e4ffa3df2bc0364df1556f7db312e473ac30497c88f3ab36f9d1f7b5d01",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.352757,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8246901c62e93cdd1d4eba4aa3aeed7775cbeb3428e7c02293c6b41515258f42"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fa7e0e4ffa3df2bc0364df1556f7db312e473ac30497c88f3ab36f9d1f7b5d01",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Cleanliness is not next to godliness nowadays, for cleanliness is made essential and godliness is regarded as an offence.",
      "output_sha256": "c30d8d6fb3e689fb64949990cccd758ee8125f8f4a86307a85eaaa66c21f08d1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "c30d8d6fb3e689fb64949990cccd758ee8125f8f4a86307a85eaaa66c21f08d1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A playwright can attack the institution of marriage so long as he does not misrepresent the manners of society, and I have met Ibsenite pessimists who thought it wrong to take beer but right to take prussic acid.",
      "output_sha256": "4484db199343fb129a3c88859412331979948082a8076f7b464ff575b6d50207",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "4484db199343fb129a3c88859412331979948082a8076f7b464ff575b6d50207",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This hypocrisy is especially pronounced regarding hygiene, particularly concerning the act of lying in bed.",
      "output_sha256": "be20385081b9570016c261b52dd6d488bedb768fddbaca3cb34a3ae1b77a64ec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.442308,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "240c0bd6f421cabb462747bc18967acee18a6043b5d198b54eaa986b7b4ec3cc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "be20385081b9570016c261b52dd6d488bedb768fddbaca3cb34a3ae1b77a64ec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Instead of viewing it, as it should be, as a matter of personal choice and comfort, many now perceive rising early as a moral obligation.",
      "output_sha256": "875bfe5e1ef47ac599bb561dfc61c065981adea1bf5d01e4918e0ca4133024b3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.420553,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7c182f5ebf111bf8b17b884e16d8e625d3ed7cb9470e7454cb3d0432340be842"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "875bfe5e1ef47ac599bb561dfc61c065981adea1bf5d01e4918e0ca4133024b3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is upon the whole part of practical wisdom; but there is nothing good about it or bad about its opposite.",
      "output_sha256": "147e420c908b187f14bcd5911d2388a52d6e973268e86f0324ea062ab95ffe3c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "147e420c908b187f14bcd5911d2388a52d6e973268e86f0324ea062ab95ffe3c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": ".....",
      "output_sha256": "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Misers get up early in the morning; and burglars, I am informed, get up the night before.",
      "output_sha256": "5e1f8cfa30edab4984acc86362095327c70c95e5434dbfdfb9514a200847e091",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "5e1f8cfa30edab4984acc86362095327c70c95e5434dbfdfb9514a200847e091",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The true danger to our society lies in the potential for its mechanisms to become overly rigid, even as its spirit becomes increasingly capricious.",
      "output_sha256": "ca599e3f0aac2f4fe4b2634eacbc2bf7dd96ae965535308cd21733a2f6dba4b9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": 0.35779,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7592a91cdc57b8ce4ec82f1cf61cdf10aeac7054a40e3b894586d8f445b7bca7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ca599e3f0aac2f4fe4b2634eacbc2bf7dd96ae965535308cd21733a2f6dba4b9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A man’s minor actions and arrangements ought to be free, flexible, creative; the things that should be unchangeable are his principles, his ideals.",
      "output_sha256": "b47c94c6f6e1a76a49f98f3a0254c871dbce4bb80bb245f9d88d184e9379349c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "b47c94c6f6e1a76a49f98f3a0254c871dbce4bb80bb245f9d88d184e9379349c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Yet, in our current reality, the opposite holds true; our opinions shift frequently, while our lunch remains unchanged.",
      "output_sha256": "2d8851e7cf4fb1cbce0501517aa73e0447f358fa20f83e3f7b291972ffbeb01c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": 0.349039,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "23a1d83147836a5c38fda8482c5377d9c9c465e0d931f6a980332764fba26953"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2d8851e7cf4fb1cbce0501517aa73e0447f358fa20f83e3f7b291972ffbeb01c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Now, I should like men to have strong and rooted conceptions, but as for their lunch, let them have it sometimes in the garden, sometimes in bed, sometimes on the roof, sometimes in the top of a tree.",
      "output_sha256": "bc08b1ad28a3ebf42e72c86131a72cda252f23c0d8ee550cdd01e5081e4a79b4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "bc08b1ad28a3ebf42e72c86131a72cda252f23c0d8ee550cdd01e5081e4a79b4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Let them argue from the same first principles, but let them do it in a bed, or a boat, or a balloon.",
      "output_sha256": "4c4fb7c6097a0a55e3b0fe44a2617c5a2dfdc987e9fe4d9d02f740b2ac4cf1b9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "4c4fb7c6097a0a55e3b0fe44a2617c5a2dfdc987e9fe4d9d02f740b2ac4cf1b9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This troubling rise of rigid habits reflects an excessive focus on virtues that mere convention can assure, while neglecting those deeper values that cannot be guaranteed by routine—values of spontaneous compassion or candid honesty.",
      "output_sha256": "18120d2f6460f2f144cd219c8b745603606a84157c803217ff47f4d7bdb62209",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.32002,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "053814cd7dfc8dea5f11a2306ea0d45a765596974610c0e1b46f6eb111ce2627"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "18120d2f6460f2f144cd219c8b745603606a84157c803217ff47f4d7bdb62209",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If ever that abrupt appeal is made to us we may fail.",
      "output_sha256": "efa9dd1e7069f2c1f0160781af505b21fc8537e9cd9224bc9092d890ad918fb9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "efa9dd1e7069f2c1f0160781af505b21fc8537e9cd9224bc9092d890ad918fb9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A man can get use to getting up at five o’clock in the morning.",
      "output_sha256": "994f10cecec77d30ee10fc44277f2eb482bdfc662bc6a1460d9e2822b31cc6b0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "994f10cecec77d30ee10fc44277f2eb482bdfc662bc6a1460d9e2822b31cc6b0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A man cannot very well get used to being burnt for his opinions; the first experiment is commonly fatal.",
      "output_sha256": "3b66adafa26c482f35da3227ca7691e914605def7c525b167161da12d7515526",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "3b66adafa26c482f35da3227ca7691e914605def7c525b167161da12d7515526",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "We ought to pay closer attention to the potential for the heroic and the unexpected.",
      "output_sha256": "839cf6b803124560ec42663c7bce276c0dbc1e9210d99926ff8ae85fa5864b1a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.502308,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ff8b7d72bbe25d64e69793fbf5510f828f364259fab1c1842a8f45b95ae0c99f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "839cf6b803124560ec42663c7bce276c0dbc1e9210d99926ff8ae85fa5864b1a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I dare say that when I get out of this bed I shall do some deed of an almost terrible virtue.",
      "output_sha256": "90a9d6818870ea5ffb799c97d0f025951bdea7f076c1401aea35843b45e5c745",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "90a9d6818870ea5ffb799c97d0f025951bdea7f076c1401aea35843b45e5c745",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "For those who master the fine art of lying in bed, there exists one crucial caution.",
      "output_sha256": "5692278b8ab7df2032df8ce19fe906a64bac84bdb6219a8660e473b140ea40a0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.655564,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "11bbddbe1da51c239491d78cde349dd3c92b9552758d87ee5231b9e3bbc0186a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5692278b8ab7df2032df8ce19fe906a64bac84bdb6219a8660e473b140ea40a0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Even for those who can do their work in bed (like journalists), still more for those whose work cannot be done in bed (as, for example, the professional harpooners of whales), it is obvious that the indulgence must be very occasional.",
      "output_sha256": "f47c5d33e4b274df8af0604a0ce342ddd0582e8f213aeddefa097e4ed5ce51bc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "f47c5d33e4b274df8af0604a0ce342ddd0582e8f213aeddefa097e4ed5ce51bc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "However, that is not the caution I wish to emphasize.",
      "output_sha256": "8578a6cbff6fc0e2b538ee852d1133cbf67cf0ae562dd017f22cd045b501bfb9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.52,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ad7cb5f3799af102bfc975af5f6aa6728e9531706ef1f284a02788c1b1a099da"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8578a6cbff6fc0e2b538ee852d1133cbf67cf0ae562dd017f22cd045b501bfb9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The caution is this: if you do lie in bed, be sure you do it without any reason or justification at all.",
      "output_sha256": "37b73425ee17a6d1c4ef3f9e4a5714929a3d9ad556c5a4252247eb691b4efff3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "37b73425ee17a6d1c4ef3f9e4a5714929a3d9ad556c5a4252247eb691b4efff3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I am not referring to those who are genuinely unwell.",
      "output_sha256": "efb51f42f39c00ee49e80f76a98be2fe1db8dde87bee5412d57d43f3b845b76d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": 0.315,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a2074aaf432351ca0435f0117a0806bc0455918d82f871af01eea519a515a962"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_ai_sha256": "efb51f42f39c00ee49e80f76a98be2fe1db8dde87bee5412d57d43f3b845b76d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But if a healthy man lies in bed, let him do it without a rag of excuse; then he will get up a healthy man.",
      "output_sha256": "039823502a3f0c0c4897b501f9728d0681a79cc3541125612aa8fd856e1b794d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "039823502a3f0c0c4897b501f9728d0681a79cc3541125612aa8fd856e1b794d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If he does it for some secondary hygienic reason, if he has some scientific explanation, he may get up a hypochondriac.",
      "output_sha256": "4c47a88a6452b97d0adcd3251b157986128460c38fc623237717bf8839580aab",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "4c47a88a6452b97d0adcd3251b157986128460c38fc623237717bf8839580aab",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
